# REQUIRES: python-api, cuda
# Device-resident buffers of a persistent simulation on a GPU
# (D[resident-buffers]), scenario updates of Inputs/python_resident.py.
# Updates of tunables, evaluations, and reads of the state between parts:
# any partition of the steps after them gives the same state to the bit.
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_resident.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide GPU updates | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: Double VelocityVerlet: after an update and an evaluation, parts of 12, 5+7, and 1+1+10 steps give the same state to the bit
# CHECK: Double Leapfrog: after an update and an evaluation, parts of 12, 5+7, and 1+1+10 steps give the same state to the bit
# CHECK: Mixed VelocityVerlet: after an update and an evaluation, parts of 12, 5+7, and 1+1+10 steps give the same state to the bit
# CHECK: Mixed Leapfrog: after an update and an evaluation, parts of 12, 5+7, and 1+1+10 steps give the same state to the bit
# CHECK: resident updates passed
